    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2021" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alterculum</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">altercum</span></b> , i, n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>henbane</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quae (herba) Apollinaris, apud Arabas altercum
					sive altercangenum, apud Graecos vero hyoscyamus appellatur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					25, 4, 17, § 35</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 181</span></i>.—Form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">al-terculum</span></b> ,
				<i><span class="en">App. Herb. 4</span></i>.</div>
